  "comboAudit": "Anchor set groep 3 (aanvankelijk lezen, klankzuiver): every anchor is sound-value-true and spelling-aligned from the illustrated library. Singles: a=appel (korte a), e=emmer (korte e), o=otter (korte o; image live-verified 200 at zoo animals 2026-07-16); i/u quiet (no illustrated noun with the short klankzuivere value — iglo rejected: pronounced with long ie); c/q/x/y quiet (outside the groep-3 letterset; c is ambiguous /s/~/k/). Vowel teams: aa=aap, ee=eend, oo=oog, ui=ui, ei=ei, au=auto (all sound-initial); oe=boek, ie=mier, eu=neus, ou=touw anchored medially — the established 'je hoort de oe in boek' convention, parallel to en's final-position sock/ring; uu quiet (no uu-initial illustrated noun). ij=ijs (image live-verified 200 at winter 2026-07-16; ijsbeer not in the vocabulary). ng=ring (final, one sound /ng/); ch quiet (/x/-initial illustrated nouns do not exist in Dutch; chocolade is /sj/ — wrong value, banned). NO sch tile: Dutch sch = s + ch, decodable from singles — shipped platform doctrine (Klankdozen gives schip four boxes; sch was removed from all nl whitelists). extraWords: ~230 high-frequency groep 3/4 words, hand-swept for profanity/anatomy/alcohol — bier/wijn/zat-class and poep/plas-class excluded or covered by neverSpeak; zat kept out despite being a normal past tense (doubles as 'drunk'). neverSpeak covers the vulgar/anatomy/alcohol/slur buildables incl. the Dutch disease-curses (kanker/tering/tyfus) and kak/pik/pis (flagged sensitive in the shipped blending decks). nonwordTTS true — Dutch TTS verklankt robotwoorden acceptably (same setting as the shipped nl blending decks).",
  "notes": "nl tray = a-z + 12 vowel-valued teams (aa ee oo uu / oe ie ui eu / ij ei / au ou, all vowel:true warm:true) + ng + ch. ij is the mandatory fused tile (one klank, one tile — never i+j). au and ou are separate tiles (same sound, different spelling — the groep-3 spelling distinction). No sch tile by platform doctrine. Quiet tiles: c q x y (outside the groep-3 core letterset), i u uu ch (no honest illustrated anchor with the correct klankwaarde)."
}
